lligent economy. More than 675,000 businesses, including McLaren Racing, Qantas, SHEIN, and TikTok, use us, directly or through our platform partners, to run their financial operations or build and monetize financial products of their own.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We started in Melbourne in 2015 to build the infrastructure global commerce runs on. We're the regulated backbone behind global payments: not by accident, but by design. A decade plus, 85+ licenses, and a financial infrastructure spanning North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia-Pacific.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're co-headquartered in San Francisco and Singapore, with more than 2,700 people across 27 offices. We hire builders with founder-level energy, people who move fast with good judgment, dig in with real curiosity, and make calls from first principles rather than waiting to be told what to do. Read our<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.airwallex.com/en-us/operating-principles"> <u>operating principles</u></a> to see it in full.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>How you'll make impact</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're expanding our senior commercial leadership footprint across France to accelerate growth across Airwallex's enterprise solutions. You'll lead the enterprise commercial organisation in France, combining strategic direction with operational sales execution across a complex, multi-product platform.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead and scale an enterprise commercial organisation of 30+ people, including three Enterprise Sales Directors, to drive performance, accountability and operational excellence across France.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own France's enterprise KPI and total regional revenue performance, introducing the sales discipline, forecasting rigour and ways of working needed to support sustained growth.</p></li><