uate opportunities based on alignment, authenticity, feasibility, potential impact, and risk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage multiple complex relationships and priorities while maintaining a high standard of execution.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>You Might Thrive in This Role If You</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have 10+ years of experience in strategic partnerships, business development, or a related field.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring an established external network and a record of building trusted relationships.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have experience originating, negotiating, and growing complex partnerships.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Can identify valuable opportunities and clearly articulate why they matter.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Quickly understand a partner’s business, audience, incentives, and concerns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are curious about technology and can identify relevant product applications.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring strong judgment around trust, rights, safety, reputation, and the sensitivities surrounding AI.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Communicate effectively with senior external partners and internal product and technical leaders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead effectively across functions, including when priorities are not fully aligned.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Thrive in fast-moving, ambiguous environments and balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About OpenAI</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">OpenAI is an AI research and deployment company dedicated to ensuring that general-purpose artificial intelligence benefits all of humanity. We push the boundaries of the capabilities of AI systems and seek to safel