rails, and model integrity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven ability to constructively challenge First Line engineering leads while maintaining the credibility to defend automated testing methodologies to external auditors and regulatory examiners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid working knowledge of industry control frameworks such as SOC 1/2, ISO 27001, and NIST CSF.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Preferred</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Direct experience building or deploying AI agents, LLM-driven audit assistants, or automated compliance and testing pipelines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fintech experience, particularly within a high-growth fintech, payments platform, digital bank, or cloud-native technology company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">People management experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with international financial technology regulations and expectations, including MAS TRM, FCA, HKMA, DORA, ASIC, and FinCEN.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience integrating GRC platforms, BI dashboards such as Tableau or Looker, and continuous compliance monitoring tools.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relevant certifications such as CISA, CISSP, CRISC, CISM, or AWS/GCP certifications.</p></li></ul><h2><br />You'll thrive here if</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’re comfortable owning the roadmap yourself.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You own the outcome and you don't wait for permission to fix what's broken.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're comfortable with ambiguity. Give you a problem, not a prescription, and you'll run with it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You say what you mean. You're direct, but you lead with respect.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You simplify complexity rather than hiding behind it.</p></li></ul><h2><br />