</strong></h4><p><span style="color:#121317">At Sunweb Group, we’re looking for an enthusiastic Talent Acquisition intern to strengthen our People, Organization &amp; Culture (POC) team. Our goal is to deliver exceptional employee experiences through a service-oriented Employee Experience approach.</span></p><p><span style="color:#121317">In this internship, you will gain hands-on experience in Recruitment, working closely with specialists focused on Processes, People Analytics, Business Partnering and broader HR topics such as Compensation &amp; Benefits and Onboarding.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">This is a unique opportunity to learn how HR and Recruitment works from A to Z while contributing your own ideas to help us attract, support, and engage our talented people.</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Assist the Talent Acquisition Specialist with recruitment activities such as drafting job postings, screening CVs, scheduling interviews, and supporting the candidate journey.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Support the full employee life cycle by handling operational tasks related to contracts, employee data, and day-to-day HR queries.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Maintain and update employee files with accuracy and attention to detail.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Collaborate closely with colleagues across the People team and other departments on both daily tasks and project-based initiatives.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Stay informed about the latest HR trends and best practices to help us continuously improve our processes.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you bring</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p>You are currently enrolled in a Bachelor’s degree programme in Human Resources, Business Administration, Marketing &amp; Communication, or a related field, and this internship forms part of your studies.</p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have a strong interest in HR and are curious to learn more about Recruitment. </span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You are detail-oriented, organized, and capable of handling multiple priorities.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You are proactive, eager to learn, and not afraid to share your own ideas.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You enjoy working with people and can build relationships across departments as well as with candidates.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You are tech-savvy and comfortable working with HR systems and digital tools.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You have good verbal and written communication skills in English (Dutch is a big plus).</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Let us introduce Sunweb Group&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Sunweb Group is one of Europe’s largest online travel agencies, sending over 1.3 million holidaymakers annually to unforgettable destinations. Operating in eight international markets, we cater to all travelers through our brands, Sunweb and ‘Eliza Was Here.’ With a team of 600 colleagues and operational hubs in Rotterdam, Girona, Paris, Copenhagen, Stockholm, Antwerp, Chambéry, and Zurich, we deliver seamless, high-quality holiday experiences at competitive prices. Our Fast Forward culture fosters focus and trust, enabling us to shape the future of holidays while helping our customers press pause and create lasting memories.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why join our journey? </span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Working for an international, ambitious, and dynamic organization</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Internship remuneration of €500 per month on full-time basis (5 days)</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We work hybrid; we’d like to see you in our Rotterdam office 3 days per week</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Attractive discount when booking with our brands (Sunweb, Eliza was Here)</span></p></li></ul><p>There is room to work on a study-related internship assignment for approximately one day per week, depending on the requirements of your study programme and in consultation with the team.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ready for departure?&nbsp;</span></strong></h4><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Do you want to become part of our team as our Talent Acquisition intern? Click on “Apply”. Do you have any questions? Please feel free to reach out to our Talent Acquisition team via </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="color:#121317">. We are looking forward to hearing from you!<br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Closing date for applications: 15 November</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:523px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1u974n7ga2/Journey_No-assmnt_Step-1.png"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em><span style="color:#121317">Sunweb Group is an equal opportunity employer, which means we do not discriminate in any way. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive and safe environment for all employees.&nbsp;</span></em><span style="font-size:1.2em"><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">#LI-Hybrid</span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317"><span style="background-color:#FFFFFF">#LI-YV1</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/sunweb-group/internship-talent-acquisition-rotterdam-95486","tags":["Internships"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1793277107},{"slug":"account-executive-belgian-french-speaking-amsterdam-22772","company_name":"Perk","title":"Account Executive - Belgian French speaking","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Us</strong><br /><br />Perk (formerly TravelPerk) is the intelligent platform for travel and spend management. Built to tackle the time-consuming, manual work that gets in the way of real work, our tools automate everything from travel bookings to expenses, invoice processing, and more. By eliminating this shadow work that wastes hours, erodes morale, and saps innovation, we're on a mission to power real work, with real impact.<br /><br />We're trusted by more than 12,000 companies worldwide, including Bolt, GoCardless, and Fabletics, and we're tackling the 7 hours of lost productivity per employee each week, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.perk.com/shadow-work-report">a $1.7 trillion problem</a>.<br /><br />Founded in 2015, Perk has grown into a global company of more than 1,800 people across 12 offices globally, with headquarters in London and Boston. We combine innovation, control, and simplicity to transform how businesses work and how people feel at work.<br /><br />At Perk, we're driven by our values, like being an owner, delivering a 7-star experience, and working as one team. We value curiosity, purpose, and mindset, not just knowledge, to unlock the power in your potential. Our talent team brings together leading minds from the travel, fintech, and SaaS industries, representing over 70 countries. If you're excited about having a real impact and shaping how millions of people experience work, we'd love you on the team.<br /><br />Visit <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://www.perk.com">www.perk.com</a> to learn more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div><div style="left:0px;width:100%;height:0px;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/4899a966-8724-4480-958f-7271e5dc2807/f3e1915d-e346-4987-a1fb-9c447e8786c0" style="top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0px" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><h2><strong>About the Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join our sales team as an<strong> Account Executive</strong> to help us drive our Benelux &amp; Nordics market! As an integral team member, you will report to the Sales Leader and work alongside motivated individuals passionate about changing how organisations manage their business travel and expenses.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for someone fearless in rolling up their sleeves, hitting the phones, and engaging with new customers to grow our client base. You should be hungry with an outbound mentality (you are expected to source a part of your pipeline yourself), perseverant, and focused, with excellent communication, relationship-building, and negotiation skills that enable you to win new clients and maintain strong relationships with existing ones.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">But that's not all - we also value collaboration and teamwork, so you should be just as motivated to help your colleagues succeed as you are to meet your targets. We take pride in our fun, challenging, and inclusive culture and seek someone who shares our passion for creating a positive work environment. If you're excited about the prospect of selling a disruptive product that is changing the game for business travel management, we want to hear from you!</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What will you be doing?</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prospecting your own pipeline and managing outbound and inbound leads for the Benelux &amp; Nordics market, mainly focusing on the Belgian market;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Presenting demos to potential clients and owning the follow-up until closing the deal (Full sales cycle);</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Seeking to understand the needs of your target prospects and articulating the value that Perk provides which is most aligned to the needs of that customer;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Conducting high-level discussions with various stakeholders, from Office Managers to CFOs;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintaining accurate information on prospects and interaction activities in Salesforce;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working closely with the Marketing team to develop new ways to increase awareness of Perk and to both evolve and improve the lead qualification process;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become an expert in Perk and our ever-evolving features.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>What we're looking for</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Native <strong>French</strong> speaker;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent communication and video presentation skills;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with the <strong>Benelux </strong>or Nordics markets;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid experience working in a Sales position and a demonstrated ability to be a pure hunter - proven track record of developing your pipeline through outbound initiatives;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of developing successful relationships with C-suite executives;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good understanding of B2B solution selling with a short sales cycle;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Being hungry and ambitious, yet ethical and sound;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Able to work as an individual contributor, but bearing in mind you are part of a team;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customer-centric mindset;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You must have legal authorisation to work in Spain.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">25 days of annual leave to rest and recharge, plus all public holidays.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>An optional pension scheme to support your long-term financial wellbeing.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A tax-efficient bike leasing scheme through Lease a Bike, for your commute or personal use.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Reimbursed commuting costs if you live more than 10km away from the office.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive compensation paired with equity in Perk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unforgettable team experiences, including our annual summer party.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comprehensive wellbeing support through Spring Health, offering fast access to 12 therapy and 12 coaching sessions for you and your loved ones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Focus on your family with 12-16 weeks’ paid parental leave</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">16 paid volunteer hours each year to give back to causes you care about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Up to 20 “Work From Anywhere” days annually to explore the world while staying connected.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A fully paid four-week sabbatical after five years with Perk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relocation support to help you move seamlessly into one of our hubs. </p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>Interview Process</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Talent Acquisition Interview - 30mins - Virtual </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessment Interview - 90 mins - Virtual</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Final Interview - 30 mins - Virtual</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Values Interview - 30mins IRL</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI at Perk</strong><br />AI is embedded in how we work across every function. The tools you'll use day-to-day are AI-enabled so you can move faster and spend more time on the work that matters. In practice, that means using AI to research and prioritise accounts, draft and refine outreach, handle customer interactions more effectively, synthesise information, and cut through shadow work - the invisible tasks that pull people away from the work only they can do - so you can focus on relationships and outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How We Work</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Perk, we take an IRL-first approach to work, where our team works together in-person 3 days a week. As such, this role requires you to be based within commuting distance of our hubs. We fundamentally believe in the value of meeting in real life to improve connectivity, productivity, creativity and ultimately making us a great place to work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For certain roles, we can help with relocation from anywhere in the world, English is the official language at the office. Please submit your resume in English if you choose to apply. Do not forget to submit an updated portfolio and/or resume.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Perk is a global company with a diverse customer base, and we want to make sure the people behind our product reflect that. We’re an equal opportunity employer, which means you’re welcome at Perk regardless of how you look, where you’re from, or anything else that makes you, well, you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Protect Yourself from Recruitment Scams</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">All official communication from Perk will always come from email addresses ending in @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://perk.com">perk.com</a> or @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://externalperk.com">externalperk.com</a>, our verified social media channels, or recruiters listed on our official LinkedIn page. We will never ask you to pay for equipment, training, or fees, request sensitive personal information such as bank details early in the process, or communicate through unofficial apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, or Signal. If you receive a message claiming to be from Perk that seems suspicious, please do not respond. Forward it to <u>security [at] perk .com</u>, and we will confirm whether it is legitimate.<br /><br />#LI-Hybrid</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/perk/account-executive-belgian-french-speaking-amsterdam-22772","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793266826},{"slug":"werkstudent-grafische-vormgeving-dtp-rotterdam-492663","company_name":"Warmako","title":"Werkstudent Grafische Vormgeving / DTP","description":"<h2>Over District 70</h2><p>District 70 ontwikkelt stijlvolle, functionele en kwalitatieve producten voor huisdieren. Met oog voor design, gebruiksgemak en detail creëren we producten die niet alleen prettig zijn voor huisdieren, maar ook mooi passen in het interieur van hun baasjes.</p><p>Van productontwikkeling en verpakkingsdesign tot de uiteindelijke presentatie: vormgeving speelt bij District 70 een belangrijke rol. Om ervoor te zorgen dat onze producten en verpakkingen er tot in de kleinste details goed uitzien, zoeken we versterking voor ons creatieve team.</p><h2>De functie</h2><p>Ben jij een nauwkeurige en creatieve student met gevoel voor grafische vormgeving? Werk je graag met Adobe InDesign, Illustrator en Photoshop en heb je oog voor de kleinste details? Dan zoeken wij jou! Voor District 70 zijn we op zoek naar een enthousiaste werkstudent die ons parttime ondersteunt bij het aanpassen, opmaken en productieklaar maken van verpakkingsontwerpen en artworks.</p><p>Je werkt nauw samen met onze Visual Designer en houdt je bezig met uiteenlopende grafische en DTP-werkzaamheden. Van het verwerken van nieuwe teksten, logo's en productinformatie tot het aanpassen van bestaande verpakkingsdesigns en het voorbereiden van bestanden voor productie.</p><p>In deze functie draait het niet alleen om creativiteit, maar vooral ook om precisie. Je hebt oog voor de kleinste details, werkt gestructureerd en zorgt ervoor dat ieder artwork zowel visueel als technisch helemaal klopt.</p><h2>Wat ga je doen?</h2><ul><li><p>Bestaande verpakkingsontwerpen aanpassen en opmaken in Adobe InDesign, Illustrator en Photoshop</p></li><li><p>Teksten, logo’s, iconen, barcodes en andere grafische elementen toevoegen, wijzigen of vervangen</p></li><li><p>Productinformatie en meertalige teksten nauwkeurig verwerken en controleren</p></li><li><p>Master carton- en inner carton-artworks (shipping marks) opmaken en aanpassen</p></li><li><p>De bestaande huisstijl en consistentie bewaken op het gebied van typografie, compositie, uitlijning en verhoudingen</p></li><li><p>Artworks drukwerk- en productieklaar maken, met aandacht voor kleurgebruik, afloop, resolutie en dielines</p></li><li><p>Correcties en feedback verwerken en bestanden zorgvuldig controleren voordat ze naar productie gaan</p></li><li><p>Bestanden, versies en correctierondes overzichtelijk beheren en archiveren</p></li><li><p>Fouten, afwijkingen en ontbrekende informatie zelfstandig signaleren en bespreken</p></li></ul><h2>Wat breng je mee?</h2><ul><li><p>Je volgt een mbo – of hbo – opleiding in de richting van Grafisch Vormgeven, Mediavormgeving, Graphic Design, DTP, Communicatie & Multimedia Design of vergelijkbaar</p></li><li><p>Goede kennis van Adobe InDesign, Illustrator en Photoshop</p></li><li><p>Je hebt kennis van of affiniteit met DTP, verpakkingsdesign en drukwerkvoorbereiding</p></li><li><p>Je bent bekend met technische begrippen zoals CMYK, Pantone, afloop, resolutie, vectorbestanden, dielines en drukklare PDF's</p></li><li><p>Je hebt een goed gevoel voor typografie, compositie en visuele consistentie</p></li><li><p>Je beheerst de Nederlandse en Engelse taal goed, zowel mondeling als schriftelijk.</p></li></ul><h2>Wat bieden wij?</h2><ul><li><p>Een afwisselende parttimefunctie van 8 tot 16 uur per week</p></li><li><p>Een passend salaris afhankelijk van kennis en ervaring</p></li><li><p>Flexibele werktijden, goed te combineren met je studie</p></li><li><p>Mogelijkheid om praktijkervaring op te doen met verpakkingsdesign, DTP en artworkproductie</p></li><li><p>Ruimte om je grafische en technische vaardigheden verder te ontwikkelen</p></li><li><p>De kans om bij te dragen aan de uitstraling van een designgericht huisdierenmerk</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/warmako/werkstudent-grafische-vormgeving-dtp-rotterdam-492663","tags":["Graphic Arts and Communication Design"],"job_types":["Deeltijdcontract","geen ervaring vereist / student"],"location":"Rotterdam","created_at":1793266290},{"slug":"ai-automation-intern-sustainability-amsterdam-334804","company_name":"Prosus","title":"AI Automation Intern (Sustainability)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who We Are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've ordered dinner through Just Eat Takeaway. You've bought and sold on OLX. You've paid with PayU. Chances are, you've already used a Prosus company today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are Prosus, a global technology company powering some of the world's leading lifestyle ecommerce businesses. Every day, billions of people across India, Latin America, Europe and beyond use our products and services to buy, sell, pay, connect and discover.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our AI-driven ecosystem spans 100+ companies across ecommerce, food delivery, fintech and experiences, serving billions of consumers worldwide. AI powers how we operate and innovate, with more than 60,000 active AI agents helping our teams build, scale and move faster. Through our investment team, we also back the founders and technologies shaping the future: From robotics and autonomous systems to synthetic biology and frontier AI.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guided by our five values <strong>Innovation, Results, People, Impact, and Entrepreneurship,</strong> culture is our competitive advantage. We thrive with experimentation; we build, we test, we learn, we iterate.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join us in shaping the future of technology at global scale.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Opportunity</strong><br /><br />Join our global sustainability reporting team and help reinvent how we use technology and AI to bring greater transparency, efficiency, and accountability to ESG reporting. As stakeholder expectations and regulations evolve, we’re building the future of sustainability intelligence.<br /><br />We’re looking for someone passionate about the intersection of tech and sustainability, who’s eager to simplify systems and data by developing digital-first tools. This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-paced, global teams and wants to shape the next generation of ESG reporting.<br /><br /><br /><strong>Who You Are</strong><br /><br />You’re passionate about sustainability and innovation, always exploring how emerging tech—like AI—can drive real-world ESG impact. You enjoy coding, structuring data, and building automated solutions that solve complex problems.<br /><br />You thrive in global, cross-functional teams, communicate inclusively, and navigate diverse work cultures with ease. Analytical and solution-oriented, you turn regulatory complexity into clear, tech-driven actions.<br /><br />An entrepreneurial self-starter, you’re adaptable, results-focused, and eager to work on cutting-edge sustainability projects.<br /><br />You’re a recent graduate with a background in tech, strategy, data, economics or sustainability, based in the Netherlands (with the right to work here), passionate about using technology to solve sustainability challenges—and ready to grow in an international, dynamic setting.<br /><br /><strong>What you bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong interest in sustainability, ESG reporting, and emerging regulations (e.g., CSRD, ESRS, ISSB). Experience in application or through studies is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passion for technology and AI, with experience or interest in process automation, data integration, or reporting systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with data analysis, coding, building AI bots, or automating systems is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable with systems such as G-suite, Microsoft Office, etc.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to distill complexity into clarity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong communication skills, with the ability to collaborate across teams and present ideas to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A self-starter mindset: proactive, adaptable, and comfortable navigating ambiguity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English; additional languages are a bonus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bachelor’s degree or higher.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why Prosus?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Prosus, your colleagues include 60,000 AI agents… and your job is to figure out what that actually means. We're one of the largest operators of agentic AI on the planet, inside a $100B+ portfolio across 100+ companies and two billion people. The humans here own what AI can't do alone: judgment, creativity, and the call on what gets built next.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Own the impact. Work the ecosystem. Earn your growth. Build with backing.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Curious about our perks and benefits? Take a look </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://prosusbenefits.com/"><em><u>at this page</u></em></a><em>.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Diversity &amp; Inclusion Commitment</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We respect the dignity and human rights of individuals and communities wherever we operate in the world. Building an inclusive workplace where everyone feels welcome and can thrive is critical for us. We provide access to education, which helps everyone understand the important role they play and the positive impact they can have.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Want to know more about life at Prosus? Explore our </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.prosus.com/the-prosus-way"><em>culture and values</em></a><em>.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/prosus/ai-automation-intern-sustainability-amsterdam-334804","tags":["People"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793256015},{"slug":"lead-backend-engineer-service-standards-amsterdam-350993","company_name":"Vinteden","title":"Lead Backend Engineer, Service Standards","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Backend Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;in the &lt;strong&gt;Service Standards&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will shape how services are built, deployed, and operated across all of Vinted. You will work closely with a team on the development of our core service framework—providing engineering teams with golden paths, robust service contracts, standardized tooling, and performance benchmarks to ensure high reliability and developer velocity at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will sit in the Service Standards team, part of the Service Ecosystem domain, reporting to the Engineering Manager of that team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Service Standards team is responsible for standardizing service startup, consumer APIs, and foundational backend frameworks across Vinted&#39;s engineering landscape. Within it, this is a senior individual-contributor role combining technical leadership with high autonomy—you will define architectural directions, establish best practices, and guide engineers across domains without requiring full management overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will collaborate closely with platform, observability, and product engineering teams to ensure our service framework and standards seamlessly integrate into daily workflows. Your work will directly impact developer experience, platform reliability, and system performance as Vinted continues to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical direction and design around service standards and golden paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve company-wide service standards, including consumer APIs, service contracts, startup routines, and performance guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable backend libraries, tools, and scaffolding to streamline new service creation and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend engineers across domains to drive adoption of framework updates and gather continuous feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate pragmatic trade-offs between architectural consistency, delivery speed, and technical debt across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Observability and Infrastructure teams to integrate telemetry, SLOs, and resilience practices into standard service templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security, privacy, and compliance guidelines are embedded directly into service contracts and framework templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior backend engineers, participate in architectural design reviews, and foster high engineering standards across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architectural proposals (RFCs/ADRs) for platform-wide backend standardization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep backend engineering experience and strong architectural intuition, with proven success building scalable services and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a track record of driving cross-team technical alignment and leading complex initiatives across multiple engineering groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess expert knowledge in designing API contracts, service startup patterns, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand trade-offs in platform design and know how to build golden paths that engineers love to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical vision and architectural choices clearly to both technical leads and engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy mentoring engineers, conducting design reviews, and sharing best practices to level up the backend engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€126.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/vinteden/lead-backend-engineer-service-standards-amsterdam-350993","tags":["Greenhouse Requisitions"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1793246121},{"slug":"senior-manager-commercial-sales-south-amsterdam-52692","company_name":"Sentinellabs","title":"Senior Manager, Commercial Sales (South)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, Commercial Sales, you will lead and inspire a team of Commercial Sales Representatives covering diverse markets and segments across Southern EMEA, driving results through hands-on coaching, strategic pipeline management, and a relentless focus on exceeding targets. You will combine deep commercial expertise with a passion for developing people, building the programs, partnerships, and team culture needed to sustain high performance in a fast-moving, competitive cybersecurity market. If you are a creative self-starter who thrives on both leading from the front and investing in the success of those around you, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, expand, and coach a team of Commercial Sales Representatives covering multiple Southern EMEA markets and segments — providing the resources, training, and day-to-day guidance needed to consistently achieve and exceed targets, including active call shadowing and ad hoc feedback sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and supervise end-to-end sales activities including prospecting, lead follow-up, opportunity qualification, proof of concept management, commercial negotiation, and deal closure, while proactively managing the team’s funnel to ensure both quantity and quality of opportunities are on track for quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and execute quarterly business plans, create and develop new programs and campaigns in conjunction with Marketing and Sales, and design incentive plans and SPIFFs that foster a competitive, collaborative, and high-energy team environment — operating with confidence and limited guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set accurate business expectations and maintain clear communication with senior sales management, measuring and reporting against KPIs and creating ad hoc reports as needed, while maintaining a thorough working knowledge of SentinelOne’s full product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in recruiting, hiring, and onboarding top commercial sales talent, and invest deeply in the growth and long-term success of each team member through mentoring, career development, and a genuine commitment to both individual and collective goal attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sales management experience in a B2B SaaS environment, with a track record of exceeding goals as both an individual contributor and a team leader — cybersecurity or endpoint security experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an indirect, two-tier go-to-market model that includes channel partners and distributors, with a solid understanding of how to maximize reach and performance through partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and lead highly skilled, motivated, and results-oriented commercial sales teams, with a passion for coaching and mentoring emerging sales talent and experience delivering both positive and constructive feedback that drives real growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills — verbal, written, and presentation — combined with strong interpersonal skills, a customer-focused mindset, and the organizational ability to create and track individual and team metrics with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creative, “roll-up-the-sleeves” self-starter attitude with the energy to thrive in a fast-paced, continuously evolving environment, and the ability to inspire a collaborative team culture focused on collective lead generation and quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
